      "content_hash": "9642f10da53b0c8ed050f0a1a9e9e928059f5d812aeeb7e40735ae0ebc0477f4",
      "content": "# Null order key — version 1 — 2026-10-20\nSymptoms: not_null, order_id, null rows, dbt_test.\nConfirm: selected invocation records failing not_null_order_id; current raw.orders profile provides null_counts and limited samples. Do not treat current counts as past counts.\nAction: developer verifies source provenance, repairs the source mapping or quarantines invalid records according to the agreed policy, preserving originals.\nPrerequisite: confirm business key definition and approved remediation policy.\nVerification: separate new execution succeeds, not_null and unique both pass, reconciled counts and aggregates are checked.\nExclude: absent column or failed connectivity; a retry alone cannot repair bad data.\n",
      "method": "lexical_overlap_checkpoint"
